  "stem": "<p>The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 1 Over 6 x EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 3\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>3</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
